CI (lint + tests + build) and smoke tests
v1.4.0
Video collections/categories with homepage filtering
Resume playback and Continue-watching history
v1.5.0
Video thumbnails on the homepage grid and admin library
Analytics dashboard (views, watch time, 30-day chart, most-watched)
v1.6.0
Installable as a desktop and mobile app (PWA) — Windows, Mac, Android, iOS
Admin is hidden in the installed app (viewer-only); still available in the browser
v1.6.1
Proper PNG app icons (fixes install prompt and the iOS/desktop home-screen icon)
Service worker now precaches app icons (still never caches private content)
v1.7.0
Push notifications — approved viewers opt in with "Notify me" and are alerted when a new video is ready
Admins can broadcast a custom push message to all viewers from the Settings tab
Off by default — inert until the VAPID keys are configured
v1.8.0
Email a share link to its recipient (opt-in on the share form) and resend it from the Shares tab
Off by default — inert until a Resend API key is configured
The installed app now shows Admin for admin accounts (previously hidden in the installed app)
v1.9.0
Bulk share: pick multiple videos and multiple recipients at once, each pair gets its own private link, one email per recipient
Per-link view count and last-viewed time, plus real playback tracking (plays, furthest % watched, completed) from the video player
Bulk resend, bulk revoke, and bulk extend for selected links, each reporting per-item success/failure
Extend a link's expiry in place, including an already-lapsed-but-not-revoked link, without creating a new link
Bundles: a recipient with 2+ active links gets one consolidated listing page and one consolidated email instead of separate ones per link
v1.10.0
Watermark playback with the viewer's email — layered control: an exemption always wins, otherwise a share's own setting beats a video's, which beats a global default in Settings
Per-video analytics in the Videos and Analytics tabs: shares, unique recipients, views, started, completed and completion rate, and average watched progress
Bulk video operations: select multiple videos to delete or assign to a collection at once
v1.12.0
Un-revoke a revoked private link in place, plus a separate "delete permanently" action once a link is already revoked
Persistent "Copy bundle link" button on every bundled share, not just the bulk-share success toast
Activity page: a viewer's own watch history, with an admin lookup by viewer email
Geo location whitelist for video access and the admin panel, via GEO_WHITELIST/ADMIN_GEO_WHITELIST, off by default
v1.13.0
Admin Settings tab: "Clean up stale data" — removes stale share bundles, stale share references, and orphaned watch-history records left behind by removed viewers
v1.14.0
Private list per video: a persistent, editable list of people with standing access, add or remove anyone any time
Adding only invites people not already on that video's list — no duplicate share, no re-sent email for people already listed
Removing someone revokes only their access to that one video, immediately; re-adding them later is a fresh invite
"Notify new people by email" checkbox on by default when adding, matching Drive/YouTube's own sharing dialogs
v1.15.0
Viewer tags: label approved viewers (e.g. "Team A") from the Viewers tab
Bulk Share: add every viewer with a given tag to the recipient list in one click, instead of pasting emails
v1.16.0
Shares list shows each link's creation date, and flags links that are part of a bundle or came in via a video's Private list
Bulk Share: "Share collection…" picker checks every video in a collection into the picklist in one click
Fix: viewer tags weren't persisting past a page refresh
v1.17.0
Private list: "Add viewers tagged…" picker adds every viewer with a given tag to the list in one click, mirroring Bulk Share's tag picker
Picture-in-Picture is now available on video playback (watch pages), via the embed player's own PiP control
v1.17.1
Regular per-video "Create link" share now accepts multiple recipient emails at once (comma/space/newline separated), each getting their own independently revocable link
Create link also gets the "Add viewers tagged…" group picker, same as Bulk Share and Private list
v1.18.0
Query Monitor: opt-in performance panel (Redis query count/time, memory, render time) on every page, toggled by the single QUERY_MONITOR_ENABLED env var — no rebuild needed
Query counts are attributed per view, including the admin panel's tabs
Admin Settings tab shows whether Query Monitor is currently enabled
